SUMMARY:Free Improv Jam! Misfit All Play Community Jam
DESCRIPTION:Misfit Improv and Acting School\n**Misfit Improv Jam**\nEver w
 anted to try improv? Come to the All Play Jam!\n\nThe Misfit Jam is open p
 lay for everyone. All experience levels. No cost. No pressure. Just improv
  and community.\n\nWant to jump in? Put your name in the bucket. When it
 ’s drawn\, you’re up and supported by players and coaches onstage. New
  or newer to improv is completely welcome.\n\nPrefer to watch? Come hang o
 ut and enjoy the chaos.\n\nHeld quarterly at the Dr. Wesley Grant Southsid
 e Community Center.\nMore info: @misfitavl \\| misfitimprov\\.com/freeeven
 ts
